WEBVTT

00:16.230 --> 00:19.610
It's Monday. This sucks. I'm tired. 
I don't want to work.

00:19.610 --> 00:22.050
I can't believe it's still 
so early in the afternoon.

00:22.050 --> 00:24.280
I want to go home.

00:28.440 --> 00:31.300
It's the Monday blues...

00:31.300 --> 00:34.190
The malaise I'm feeling is unbearable, too.

00:34.800 --> 00:37.300
Yeah, the first day of the work 
week is always rough.

00:37.770 --> 00:42.550
Yeah, right. Fukuzawa, you come 
in every Monday raring to go.

00:43.020 --> 00:45.260
You looked so alert this morning!

00:46.250 --> 00:48.810
Are you doing something to fight the blues?

00:48.810 --> 00:51.440
Huh? Not really.

00:52.830 --> 00:55.600
Maybe you're drinking some 
super rare enzyme or something!

00:56.080 --> 00:59.160
Or maybe you see an osteopathic 
doctor that has godly hands?!

00:59.160 --> 01:01.660
What kind of image do you have of me?!

01:03.450 --> 01:04.850
<i></i>Am<i> I doing anything?</i>

01:10.390 --> 01:12.170
<i>Sunday night.</i>

01:12.710 --> 01:14.050
It's coming!

01:14.050 --> 01:15.970
It's almost here!

01:15.970 --> 01:18.120
Monday is almost here!

01:18.120 --> 01:20.140
Who said it has to come?!

01:20.140 --> 01:23.470
It's crazy that we only have two days to 
rest when we work so hard for five days!

01:23.470 --> 01:27.980
I don't want to squeeze 
into a full train car again!

01:43.870 --> 01:50.960
<b>The Masterful Cat
Is Depressed Again Today</b>

02:58.240 --> 03:01.610
Can

02:58.240 --> 03:01.610
<b>The Masterful Cat Runs Away From Home?</b>

03:01.740 --> 03:02.950
<b>The Masterful Cat Runs Away From Home?</b>

03:01.820 --> 03:02.950
Can

03:02.950 --> 03:05.050
<i>Sunday night, continued...</i>

03:05.050 --> 03:08.520
I don't want to squeeze 
into a full train car again!

03:08.520 --> 03:10.550
Monday is almost here!

03:10.550 --> 03:12.510
Who said it has to come?!

03:12.510 --> 03:16.710
It's crazy that we only have two days to 
rest when we work so hard for five days!

03:16.710 --> 03:18.880
<i>This is Sa*ae!</i>

03:18.840 --> 03:19.300
Bwap

03:19.010 --> 03:19.550
<i>Push</i>

03:19.920 --> 03:23.390
I just heard Sa*ae-san's voice.

03:23.010 --> 03:26.810
<i></i>Fluster

03:23.390 --> 03:25.650
It's all over!

03:25.650 --> 03:26.810
<i>Sunday, that is.</i>

03:27.350 --> 03:29.490
I want to go back to Friday night!

03:29.490 --> 03:32.230
Or I want to jump forward 
to next Friday night!

03:32.230 --> 03:34.770
Why can't every day be Saturday?!

03:34.770 --> 03:35.150
<b>Poff</b>

03:36.070 --> 03:40.070
<i></i><b>Push...</b>

03:37.170 --> 03:38.350
What're you...

03:40.070 --> 03:44.320
Breathe in
Breath out

03:44.320 --> 03:49.830
Sniff

03:44.910 --> 03:46.590
It smells so good.

03:46.590 --> 03:49.270
Thanks, I feel so much calmer.

03:49.830 --> 03:54.830
Sniff

03:49.830 --> 03:54.830
Why do your toe beans smell like happiness?

03:54.830 --> 03:58.790
They smell like the sun, 
but a little sweeter.

03:54.830 --> 04:00.840
Sniff

03:56.130 --> 04:00.840
Not sure how to
 feel about this

03:58.790 --> 04:00.840
Something like popcorn.

04:02.760 --> 04:05.880
I want to carry around this 
scent and warmth with me.

04:05.880 --> 04:10.330
Maybe mankind needs to carry around 
cats instead of smartphones?

04:10.330 --> 04:13.100
I could survive a full train car with...

04:13.850 --> 04:16.410
Full train car?

04:17.370 --> 04:18.860
A full train car?!

04:19.600 --> 04:23.580
Monday is coming!

04:25.280 --> 04:28.240
Huff

04:28.690 --> 04:30.220
<i>Three hours later...</i>

04:31.120 --> 04:33.030
I want to live in the countryside.

04:33.030 --> 04:36.750
I don't want to live such
 a busy lifestyle in the city.

04:36.750 --> 04:39.070
I want a slow lifestyle where two train cars

04:36.750 --> 04:41.760
<i></i>Whimper

04:39.070 --> 04:41.440
are spacious enough to 
fit all the commuters.

04:42.070 --> 04:45.760
I've always wanted to live in 
an old house that's been renovated.

04:45.800 --> 04:51.640
<i></i><b>Warmth</b>

04:46.290 --> 04:49.500
Maybe you can open up a small 
Japanese-style restaurant, Yukichi.

04:49.500 --> 04:52.460
We could have a little 
vegetable field in the forest.

04:55.390 --> 04:56.460
<i>The forest.</i>

04:57.440 --> 04:58.900
<i>Bears.</i>

05:01.900 --> 05:03.940
It's a bear!

05:03.990 --> 05:05.900
<b>Meow</b>

05:04.470 --> 05:05.900
<i>Shoo*ing accident!</i>

05:06.850 --> 05:08.580
Huh? Why not?!

05:08.580 --> 05:10.910
Is it because you're so 
attached to our house?!

05:12.230 --> 05:14.410
Ugh, I can't sleep.

05:15.180 --> 05:17.120
Can I drink a beer?

05:17.120 --> 05:19.500
I'll brush my teeth again afterward.

05:21.530 --> 05:25.300
But I can't fall asleep at this rate!

05:27.050 --> 05:33.060
Purr

05:28.000 --> 05:31.110
What's with this superbly 
comfortable vibration?

05:36.890 --> 05:38.560
<i>Mission complete.</i>

05:47.910 --> 05:51.400
I don't think I do anything 
particularly special.

05:54.720 --> 05:59.080
Well, maybe my cat lets me 
cuddle more on Sundays?

06:00.210 --> 06:03.810
It gets more clingy because 
it knows you're leaving?

06:03.810 --> 06:05.210
How cute!

06:05.820 --> 06:09.090
No, he's not really that type of cat.

06:09.090 --> 06:12.350
Cats are full of healing properties.

06:12.350 --> 06:16.340
I heard that their toe beans and purring 
have huge effects on people!

06:17.280 --> 06:22.230
I've read that the pheromones from their 
toe beans have a calming effect on people.

06:22.230 --> 06:26.090
Their purring is thought to 
alleviate stress, expedite healing,

06:26.090 --> 06:29.240
and strengthen the immune system.

06:29.240 --> 06:33.330
The effects are significant enough that there's 
even research for the use of cat therapy!

06:34.400 --> 06:38.580
Aren't cats a little too overpowered?! 
Maybe I should get one, too.

06:36.250 --> 06:37.840
<i>So...</i>

06:38.580 --> 06:39.750
You'll end up an old maid.

06:39.750 --> 06:41.430
What?!

06:39.750 --> 06:43.250
<i>I was getting cat therapy!</i>

06:43.250 --> 06:46.920
<i>A world where every person carries a cat.</i>

06:47.260 --> 06:57.770
Sniff
 Snort
 Huff
 Sniff
 Heave

06:49.930 --> 06:52.380
Wouldn't that solve everything?!

06:52.380 --> 06:54.380
Am I a genius?!

06:55.100 --> 06:56.970
<i>The eyes of a cat looking at an idiot.</i>

06:58.570 --> 07:00.770
<i>Thank you very much.</i>

07:08.510 --> 07:13.180
<i>Lately, Yukichi has been making 
some weird rhythmic noises.</i>

07:13.570 --> 07:19.120
<i>He does it while he's doing housework 
or if he's in a good mood.</i>

07:19.120 --> 07:23.000
<i>I've been writing it off 
as some random humming, but...</i>

07:23.580 --> 07:26.150
<i>I realized something after going to 
the concert at the aquarium</i>

07:26.150 --> 07:29.760
<i>and listening to their music a lot.</i>

07:30.790 --> 07:34.340
<i>He's beatboxing to UMYU-Sea's songs!</i>

07:34.340 --> 07:37.500
<i>And the thing he's doing right now...</i>

07:37.890 --> 07:42.060
<i>We're not clione sea angels!</i>

07:42.060 --> 07:43.440
<i>We're...</i>

07:43.440 --> 07:44.650
<i>We're...</i>

07:44.650 --> 07:47.150
<i>Idols of the sea!</i>

07:45.990 --> 07:52.400
<i>It's their debut single, 
"We're Not Clione Sea Angels"!</i>

07:52.400 --> 07:53.580
<i>He's so talented!</i>

07:53.580 --> 07:56.910
<i>This is a great song. I love it, too!</i>

07:56.910 --> 07:59.910
<i>I want to tell him that, but I can't!</i>

08:01.210 --> 08:05.570
<i>Last time, when I snuck a shot of Yukichi 
dancing since he was so darn cute...</i>

08:13.550 --> 08:15.970
No! No! No! No!

08:13.550 --> 08:17.850
<i>He got so mad he never 
danced like that again.</i>

08:15.970 --> 08:17.850
I'm not deleting it! I'm not!

08:20.300 --> 08:26.820
<i>If he thinks I'm teasing him again, 
he'll never let me hear his beatboxing!</i>

08:27.980 --> 08:31.370
<i>Maybe it's okay as long as it 
doesn't seem like I'm teasing him?</i>

08:31.710 --> 08:33.980
<i>Yeah, like...</i>

08:35.990 --> 08:39.700
That was some amazing 
beatboxing! It was so moving!

08:35.990 --> 08:40.870
Compliment

08:40.870 --> 08:44.600
<i>Yeah, he'd definitely get angry.</i>

08:44.600 --> 08:47.540
<i>Maybe I could join in nonchalantly?</i>

08:47.540 --> 08:51.200
We're not clione sea angels!

08:50.630 --> 08:51.800
<i>Anger</i>

08:52.290 --> 08:54.300
<i>How about adding an offhanded request?</i>

08:54.300 --> 08:57.680
Oh! I want to hear 
"Sesame and Salt Parade" next!

08:57.680 --> 08:58.640
<i>Anger</i>

08:59.140 --> 09:01.810
<i>Maybe I should challenge him 
to a sudden beatbox battle?</i>

09:01.810 --> 09:06.020
<i>Doom Doom Don
 Tsk Tsk Housh Yeah!</i>

09:05.190 --> 09:06.020
<i>Anger</i>

09:06.740 --> 09:07.860
<i>It's no use!</i>

09:07.860 --> 09:10.250
<i>I can't think of a way to bring it up 
without being annoying!</i>

09:10.250 --> 09:12.820
<i>And I've never beatboxed before!</i>

09:16.570 --> 09:20.770
<i>He'll close his heart to me 
forever if I'm too careless.</i>

09:20.770 --> 09:24.530
<i>I'm sure the door to his heart will be 
harder to open than Ama-no-Iwato.</i>

09:26.740 --> 09:28.440
<i>Ama-no-Iwato?!</i>

09:35.290 --> 09:39.360
<i>We're not clione sea angels!</i>

09:39.360 --> 09:40.770
<i>We're...</i>

09:40.770 --> 09:42.100
<i>We're...</i>

09:42.100 --> 09:44.980
<i>Idols of the sea!</i>

09:48.400 --> 09:49.860
Sway...

09:49.190 --> 09:53.140
<i>All of the sea and the sky.</i>

09:50.120 --> 09:51.870
<i>All right! He took the bait!</i>

09:51.870 --> 09:53.860
<i>Now, join me, Yukichi!</i>

09:53.140 --> 09:58.060
<i>We'll protect all of the earth.</i>

09:54.530 --> 09:56.860
<b>Yank</b>

09:56.030 --> 09:56.860
<b>Pull</b>

09:58.060 --> 09:59.420
Uh, Yukichi?

09:59.800 --> 10:00.870
Yukichi-san?

10:03.330 --> 10:04.870
<b>Rewind 30 seconds</b>

10:03.330 --> 10:04.870
<b>Beep</b>

10:03.730 --> 10:04.870
<i>No. This isn't it.</i>

10:04.910 --> 10:08.870
<b>Stare...</b>

10:05.590 --> 10:08.870
<i>This isn't what I was hoping for!</i>

10:08.870 --> 10:10.340
<i>Hey!</i>

10:10.840 --> 10:14.880
<i>I was forced to practice for two hours...</i>

10:17.880 --> 10:22.640
<b>Wheeze
Pant</b>

10:20.000 --> 10:22.640
<i>Doesn't realize he's doing it out loud.</i>

10:25.960 --> 10:28.460
I'm home, Yukichi.

10:29.740 --> 10:34.230
I'm already at my limit. 
I can't move another muscle.

10:34.230 --> 10:37.260
I don't even have the energy to eat.

10:39.640 --> 10:44.830
Th-The smell of pork soup, 
hokke fish, and Chinese salad!

10:44.830 --> 10:46.910
Thanks for the meal!

10:48.250 --> 10:49.680
So delicious!

10:49.680 --> 10:53.420
Eating Yukichi's food is 
the best when you're tired.

10:53.890 --> 10:55.920
I can feel the warmth!

10:56.900 --> 10:59.060
Do you have another 
serving of this pork soup?!

11:02.430 --> 11:04.210
Huh? What's this?!

11:03.930 --> 11:04.930
<b><i>Hmph!!</i></b>

11:04.210 --> 11:05.930
I'm allowed to drink another one today?!

11:07.940 --> 11:09.460
What's going on?!

11:26.750 --> 11:28.330
It's the weekend!

11:28.790 --> 11:30.820
I'm going to laze around all day!

11:31.250 --> 11:32.120
Ow!

11:31.250 --> 11:32.120
<b>Gonk</b>

11:32.970 --> 11:34.430
What?!

11:34.430 --> 11:38.600
You should let me pet you a bit!

11:39.110 --> 11:42.190
What's the point of having such 
luxurious fur if I can't pet it?

11:42.190 --> 11:43.360
Stingy!

11:44.260 --> 11:47.140
<b>Zmoosh...</b>

11:45.210 --> 11:47.910
I'm sorry for being cocky!

11:47.910 --> 11:51.210
A cat's luxurious fur is all for itself!

11:51.210 --> 11:52.890
I'm so sorry!

11:54.000 --> 11:55.480
<i>Sunday.</i>

11:59.230 --> 12:01.270
I slept so well.

12:01.270 --> 12:02.910
It's already the afternoon.

12:02.910 --> 12:04.490
Yukichi?

12:06.110 --> 12:08.490
Huh? Did he go shopping?

12:09.040 --> 12:11.290
Oh, I see brunch waiting for me!

12:11.830 --> 12:13.420
Thanks for the mea...

12:14.830 --> 12:16.500
<i>Yukichi's purse.</i>

12:16.500 --> 12:17.880
Huh?

12:18.300 --> 12:19.630
Huh? Huh?

12:19.630 --> 12:21.800
His purse?! There's money in it!

12:21.800 --> 12:23.050
Huh?!

12:23.050 --> 12:26.050
Yukichi actually forgot something?!

12:26.470 --> 12:28.560
<i>Maybe he has a fever?!</i>

12:28.950 --> 12:32.310
<i>People say that animals tend to 
hide the fact that they're sick!</i>

12:32.780 --> 12:36.020
<i>No. No. I'm probably overreacting.</i>

12:36.430 --> 12:38.320
<i>Huh?</i>

12:38.850 --> 12:43.180
<i>But where do I take him if he's really sick?!</i>

12:43.180 --> 12:44.820
<i>NASA?!</i>

12:44.820 --> 12:47.320
Yukichi!

12:51.000 --> 12:52.550
Oh! Nishina-san!

12:52.550 --> 12:54.180
Welco...

12:55.670 --> 12:57.630
Whoa! Yukichi-san's...

12:57.630 --> 13:00.060
I-It's been a while.

13:00.060 --> 13:03.760
Oh! I'm sorry about leaving 
you behind like that last time.

13:03.760 --> 13:05.760
S-Someone! Help!

13:05.760 --> 13:07.720
A bear?!

13:07.720 --> 13:09.720
Don't call me stupid!

13:09.720 --> 13:11.220
You stupid bear!

13:32.770 --> 13:35.250
Were you all right after?

13:35.650 --> 13:39.160
I really wanted to thank you 
for helping me last time.

13:39.160 --> 13:41.620
He actually stopped bothering me after that.

13:42.000 --> 13:44.260
Please let me thank you properly sometime!

13:44.260 --> 13:46.580
No, no! You don't need to do that!

13:46.580 --> 13:49.260
I even let you take care 
of the police last time...

13:49.260 --> 13:52.230
U-Um, may I ask you for your name?!

13:52.230 --> 13:54.270
Oh, I'm Fukuzawa.

13:54.740 --> 13:58.810
<i>This reminds me of 
the first time I met Yuri-chan.</i>

13:57.690 --> 13:58.810
Senpai!

13:58.810 --> 14:00.310
Fukuzawa-san...

14:00.310 --> 14:03.320
Oh, so, Yukichi-san must be Fukuzawa Yuki—

14:05.670 --> 14:06.950
That's right.

14:06.950 --> 14:09.950
My parents were planning to give me 
that name if I'd been a boy.

14:10.520 --> 14:13.450
That's right! Did Yukichi stop by here?!

14:13.970 --> 14:16.080
Y-Yes, he did.

14:17.190 --> 14:20.580
He was getting a very warm welcome
 from our manager over there...

14:21.480 --> 14:24.510
Thank you for visiting our store once again!

14:24.510 --> 14:26.170
Did you have any problems 
during your visit today?

14:25.260 --> 14:26.170
<i>Why?!</i>

14:26.170 --> 14:30.550
Our cat goods are fully 
stocked today, as well!

14:26.590 --> 14:29.980
Our manager really likes cats. I'm sorry.

14:30.340 --> 14:32.600
Oh, no. Thank you.

14:30.550 --> 14:34.000
Please take your time to browse our wares!

14:32.600 --> 14:35.710
I'm sorry for letting a cat shop 
at a store that sells food.

14:36.850 --> 14:39.150
The manager allows it.

14:39.150 --> 14:42.470
I'm sure it's fine since we've never 
gotten a complaint about him, either.

14:42.860 --> 14:45.300
Actually, people seem to like his visits.

14:45.300 --> 14:48.360
I-I see. Thank goodness.

14:49.010 --> 14:53.480
<i>We live together, but there's 
a lot I don't know about him.</i>

14:53.480 --> 14:57.370
<i>He's more familiar with 
the neighborhood than I am.</i>

14:57.770 --> 15:02.380
Oh, I should go say hello to the manager.

15:03.150 --> 15:04.480
<i>As his owner.</i>

15:04.480 --> 15:07.420
Oh, wait! If possible, please stay hidden.

15:08.790 --> 15:12.920
It'll be really gross if he discovers 
new information about Yukichi-san

15:12.920 --> 15:14.890
and he gets even more fixated.

15:15.390 --> 15:18.890
<i>Looks like he's way more familiar 
with others than I thought.</i>

15:19.390 --> 15:22.400
Oh! He's finally escaped!

15:22.840 --> 15:24.810
Hey, Yukichi!

15:25.460 --> 15:27.400
<i>Good work.</i>

15:29.730 --> 15:32.910
You forgot your purse, so I brought it over.

15:32.910 --> 15:36.410
Jeez! How can you go shopping without money?

15:36.910 --> 15:39.660
Money? Huh? But Yukichi-san...

15:41.830 --> 15:46.800
<b>Swp...</b>

15:42.430 --> 15:44.670
Doesn't he pay with his card now?

15:44.670 --> 15:46.210
<i>Cashless?!</i>

15:47.320 --> 15:49.160
Thank you.

15:49.590 --> 15:53.430
He started using it right after we 
started our reward points program.

15:53.430 --> 15:56.830
He uses the point card and 
coupons very skillfully.

15:56.830 --> 15:59.050
Such a fearsome cat!

16:03.300 --> 16:07.220
I jumped to conclusions, 
but I'm glad it wasn't anything serious.

16:07.220 --> 16:10.940
I thought you were running a fever 
when I discovered you forgot something.

16:11.300 --> 16:15.250
I'm sure there aren't many veterinarians 
that could examine you, Yukichi.

16:15.250 --> 16:17.230
What should we do in the future?

16:19.450 --> 16:25.960
<b>N{*\3c&H0E3818&}akayoshi Animal Hospital</b>

16:21.670 --> 16:22.990
No way!

16:22.990 --> 16:25.490
That's a normal animal hospital!

16:25.490 --> 16:28.170
I only took you there once 
when you were a kitten!

16:28.170 --> 16:29.350
Let's hurry home!

16:29.350 --> 16:30.940
I'm hungry!

16:33.540 --> 16:35.470
Come on! Rare! Come on!

16:36.300 --> 16:38.430
<i>Since she brought the cash,</i>

16:36.970 --> 16:42.980
Gacha
Gacha
Gacha

16:37.260 --> 16:40.400
Come on! Rare! Come on!

16:38.430 --> 16:42.980
<i>she gave Yukichi permission for extra 
tries on the UMYU-Sea gacha machine.</i>

16:45.670 --> 16:47.730
<i>I am a cat.</i>

16:48.620 --> 16:54.400
<i>Ever since that snowy night, 
I've found it to be strange.</i>

16:58.650 --> 17:03.160
<i>Why doesn't anyone come to collect 
the garbage from this trash dump?</i>

17:04.680 --> 17:11.390
<i>And why doesn't this human 
mind this wretched state?!</i>

17:11.390 --> 17:14.900
<i>Now she's even sleeping 
at the front entrance?!</i>

17:18.010 --> 17:18.970
<b>Meow</b>

17:18.970 --> 17:19.890
Huh? It's morning?!

17:20.420 --> 17:22.160
Whoa! Sorry, Yukichi!

17:22.160 --> 17:23.480
You must be hungry!

17:23.480 --> 17:25.020
I'll pour you some kibble 
and water right now!

17:25.020 --> 17:27.890
<i>Though she never forgets 
to take care of <i>me</i>.</i>

17:30.930 --> 17:32.530
Hurry! Hurry!

17:32.530 --> 17:35.470
<i>She fails to take care of herself.</i>

17:36.150 --> 17:38.410
<i>A stray cat knows.</i>

17:39.070 --> 17:42.410
Shoot! I'm missing a button! Oh, who cares!

17:39.070 --> 17:43.160
<i>A creature that cannot even take care 
of itself cannot live for long.</i>

17:43.800 --> 17:46.960
<i>She'll just drag me down with her if I stay.</i>

17:46.960 --> 17:49.920
<i>I should leave as soon as I find the chance.</i>

17:49.080 --> 17:50.720
I'm off!

17:58.810 --> 18:00.430
<i>The perfect chance!</i>

18:00.430 --> 18:02.010
<i>Now, is the time to leave!</i>

18:08.230 --> 18:11.150
My, what a lovely day.

18:12.650 --> 18:15.150
<i>That human is carrying trash bags with her.</i>

18:15.700 --> 18:17.700
<i>Today must be trash day!</i>

18:19.010 --> 18:24.620
<i>Well, I can take care of a bag 
to pay her back for her kindness.</i>

18:41.610 --> 18:45.560
<i>It was so easy. 
Anyone should be able to do this.</i>

18:45.560 --> 18:47.420
<i>I should take another out.</i>

18:48.280 --> 18:49.370
<i>No! No!</i>

18:49.370 --> 18:52.640
<i>What am I trying to go back for?!</i>

18:53.440 --> 18:54.820
Oh, no.

18:55.390 --> 18:58.060
Saku-chan left her door open.

18:58.060 --> 19:00.570
She really doesn't look after herself.

19:01.040 --> 19:03.890
<i>So that human is called Saku.</i>

19:03.890 --> 19:07.200
I should at least close the door for her.

19:07.630 --> 19:09.570
<i>Please do so.</i>

19:09.570 --> 19:10.970
<i>"Saku."</i>

19:10.970 --> 19:13.210
<i>I will remember your name...</i>

19:18.640 --> 19:24.720
<i>...though we will probably 
never cross paths again.</i>

19:29.290 --> 19:30.240
I'm late!

19:30.240 --> 19:32.690
I fell asleep in my suit!

19:33.090 --> 19:36.440
A c-c-cockroach in the b-b-bathroom!

19:36.440 --> 19:38.650
<b>Yukichi's House</b>

19:39.190 --> 19:40.760
Yukichi...

19:49.250 --> 19:51.440
I bought some cans of cat food!

20:11.540 --> 20:14.640
If you have nowhere to go, 
how about coming with me?

20:21.480 --> 20:24.060
Did something just run by?

20:28.850 --> 20:30.290
<i>What?</i>

20:30.290 --> 20:34.170
<i>I thought of her stupid face 
and my body moved on its own.</i>

20:41.620 --> 20:43.170
<i>I see.</i>

20:43.170 --> 20:47.280
<i>This place must already be my home.</i>

20:43.170 --> 20:48.180
<b>Yukichi's House</b>

20:48.180 --> 20:51.870
<i>A creature that cannot even take care 
of itself cannot live for long.</i>

20:51.870 --> 20:54.940
<i>I do not wish to die together.</i>

20:56.580 --> 20:59.620
<i>So I merely need to 
take care of her myself.</i>

20:59.020 --> 20:59.980
<b>Meow</b>

21:03.850 --> 21:05.800
<i>With my own paws!</i>

21:08.690 --> 21:10.410
I'm home.

21:11.150 --> 21:13.970
I bought some food and stuff.

21:13.970 --> 21:17.420
<i>However, don't be mistaken, worthless human.</i>

21:18.650 --> 21:20.420
Eat to your heart's content!

21:21.080 --> 21:25.540
Lately, you've been eating a lot. 
Is it because you're growing?

21:25.540 --> 21:28.430
<i>This is all for the sake 
of tomorrow's cat can.</i>

21:29.910 --> 21:34.060
<i>First, I must be able to 
open that door on my own!</i>

23:06.900 --> 23:18.540
<b>Next Episode</b>

23:07.230 --> 23:09.570
<i>A masterful cat knows.</i>

23:09.570 --> 23:13.450
<i>You can easily make rice balls 
using saran wrap and a cup.</i>

23:13.450 --> 23:15.210
<i>Give it a try.</i>

23:15.210 --> 23:18.540
<i>Next episode: "The Masterful Cat 
Is Depressed Tomorrow As Well."</i>

23:18.540 --> 23:21.920
Can

23:18.540 --> 23:21.920
<b>The Masterful Cat Is Depressed Tomorrow As Well</b>

23:19.050 --> 23:21.870
<i>Even tomorrow, taking care 
of my owner is troublesome.</i>
